Our second meeting of Fall 2018 took place **Tuesday Sept 25,** from **11.50-1.10p** in **Allbritton 004**.

Prof. [Pavel Oleinikov](https://www.wesleyan.edu/academics/faculty/poleinikov/profile.html) presented a workshop on Extracting Place Names from a Text using a bit of R coding. This was an exciting opportunity for all of us to start actively sharing methodologies. It was quite an adventure in getting a number of us with little no coding experience to try our hand!

